This repository contains a portable public evaluation pipeline adapted from
Goedel-Prover-V2 (https://github.com/Goedel-LM/Goedel-Prover-V2).

The technical Python pipeline, shell orchestration, environment and toolchain
files, and configuration files adapt public upstream material and conventions.
This includes prompt construction, proof extraction, Lean verification, and
benchmark-specific evaluation logic. The upstream README identifies
Goedel-Prover-V2 as licensed under the Apache License 2.0. This distribution
retains the Apache License 2.0 text in LICENSE.

The Mathlib4 dependency is separately identified by the repository submodule
metadata and is not vendored in this source tree.
